# PHP / Symfony API

- PHP ≥ 8.5, Symfony 8.1 packages.
- Serializer groups: `Symfony\Component\Serializer\Attribute\Groups`.
- Login body: `{ "email", "password" }` → JWT in `data.jwt_token`.
- Register body: `firstname`, `email`, `password`, `repeatPassword`, `acceptPrivacyPolicy`.
- Keep Nelmio CORS; do not restore broken `.htaccess` OPTIONS redirects.
- Avoid obsolete Doctrine config keys removed for SF8/DBAL4.
- Run tests with `php bin/phpunit` inside `mood_dic-php-1`.
